codex
Both central source premises hold: `sh` exits at −1, and the 64-bit handler uses `uint64_t`. Site A also has an endpoint problem: saving `sh` alone would omit the final mask bit and can let the loop run past bit 63. I found the manual in the project root’s `_scratchpad`, one directory above `GXEMUL-SEC`, and am checking its wraparound rules.

